  "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><h1 data-lake-id=\"ddScc\" id=\"ddScc\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud5e229ae\" id=\"ud5e229ae\">1&gt; 功能需求</span></h1><p data-lake-id=\"ue3778c0f\" id=\"ue3778c0f\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua606167f\" id=\"ua606167f\">实现一个计算器程序，能够完成+，-，*，/等；</span></p><card type=\"block\" name=\"hr\" value=\"data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22cjPy4%22%7D\"></card><h1 data-lake-id=\"z48Es\" id=\"z48Es\"><span data-lake-id=\"udb508fe7\" id=\"udb508fe7\">2&gt; 程序设计</span></h1><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23include%20%3Cstdio.h%3E%5Cn%5Cn%2F%2F%20%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%E5%A3%B0%E6%98%8E%5Cndouble%20add(double%20a%2C%20double%20b)%3B%5Cndouble%20sub(double%20a%2C%20double%20b)%3B%5Cn%5Cnint%20main()%20%5Cn%7B%5Cn%5Ctdouble%20num1%20%3D%2010%3B%5Cn%5Ctdouble%20num2%20%3D%203%3B%5Cn%5Ct%5Cn%5Ctdouble%20y%20%3D%20add(num1%2C%20num2)%3B%5Cn%5Ctprintf(%5C%22y%20%3D%20%25.2f%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2C%20y)%3B%5Cn%5Ct%5Cn%5Cty%20%3D%20sub(num1%2C%20num2)%3B%5Cn%5Ctprintf(%5C%22y%20%3D%20%25.2f%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2C%20y)%3B%5Cn%5Ct%5Cn%5Ctreturn%200%3B%5Cn%7D%5Cn%5Cn%5Cn%2F%2F%20%E5%8A%A0%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%9E%E7%8E%B0%5Cndouble%20add(double%20a%2C%20double%20b)%20%5Cn%7B%5Cn%5Ctreturn%20a%20%2B%20b%3B%5Cn%7D%5Cn%5Cn%2F%2F%20%E5%87%8F%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%9E%E7%8E%B0%5Cndouble%20sub(double%20a%2C%20double%20b)%20%5Cn%7B%5Cn%5Ctreturn%20a%20-%20b%3B%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22G4yuk%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><card type=\"block\" name=\"hr\" value=\"data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22jBdlU%22%7D\"></card><h1 data-lake-id=\"pRNVT\" id=\"pRNVT\"><span data-lake-id=\"u509f1a7d\" id=\"u509f1a7d\">3&gt; 存在问题</span></h1><p data-lake-id=\"u1655fafe\" id=\"u1655fafe\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5d485746\" id=\"u5d485746\">🐼</span><span data-lake-id=\"u739ed9a7\" id=\"u739ed9a7\">代码维护性差：</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"uf83d2bde\" id=\"uf83d2bde\" style=\"text-indent: 2em\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue350c013\" id=\"ue350c013\">所有函数堆叠在一个文件中，超过300行后维护困难；</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u6eb3c23f\" id=\"u6eb3c23f\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4cbc7889\" id=\"u4cbc7889\">🐪</span><span data-lake-id=\"u5f2565db\" id=\"u5f2565db\">无法模块化复用：</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u86cb06b2\" id=\"u86cb06b2\" style=\"text-indent: 2em\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2b02ee69\" id=\"u2b02ee69\">想在新项目中复用计算功能， 又必须打开文件，拷贝计算相关的函数；</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u33432730\" id=\"u33432730\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9e8b5c59\" id=\"u9e8b5c59\">❓</span><span data-lake-id=\"u33750249\" id=\"u33750249\">想象下，把语文，数学，英语，放到一篇文章里，是件恐怖的事，所以必须分不同书，不同的章节；</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ub65374be\" id=\"ub65374be\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud8e76ec1\" id=\"ud8e76ec1\">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"udce3ee74\" id=\"udce3ee74\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7e59b6f2\" id=\"u7e59b6f2\">查看 51/32的工程，感受分文件编程的重要性；</span></p>",
